    "project_template_level_name": "building-data-driven-systems-lesson3-templateC-test-2025",
    "long_instructions": "You are a content creator with a dedicated fanbase. Your viewers need to know exactly when to tune in for specific games. To keep them notified, you use a Social Media Scheduler.\r\n\r\nBased on the updates that you receive over the next four levels, use **PAIR Programming with AI** to  help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🎮 DLC Release!\r\n**Status:** New Event Added\r\n\r\n**Details:** A massive expansion pack for your favorite RPG drops this Friday. You need to schedule a marathon stream to cover it.\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** Add this stream event to the end of your schedule by writing a helper function that will push() the event to the end of the schedule.\r\n\r\n* **Title:** \"DLC Marathon\"\r\n* **Content:** \"Exploring the new expansion map all night!\"\r\n* **Image:** \"dlc.jpg\"\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n::: details [**🔎 Hint**]\r\n**Step 1:**\r\n- Helper functions will need to be added to the `JS` file to `push()` each element of the new event (title, content, and image.)\r\n\r\nAsk AI to help create a helper function in JavaScript to push a new event.\r\n\r\n**Step 2:**\r\n- The `HTML` file will need to be updated to include new elements to hold the new event.\r\n\r\nAsk AI to update the HTML file so a new event can be displayed at the bottom of the app. \r\n\r\n**Step 3:**\r\n- The DOM elements and the renderFeed() function will need to be updated.\r\n\r\nAsk AI to update the DOM elements and renderFeed() function to include the new HTLM elements to display the new event.\r\n\r\n**Step 4:**\r\n- Call the helper function.\r\n\r\nIf the AI didn't already do this on the previous step, make sure the helper function is correclty called before the renderFeed() function is calle. \r\n\r\n- Ask AI to help you with each one separately. \r\n:::",
